= Spells =
Beastlords use a mix of buffs, heals, slows, and utility spells to support themselves, their warder, and their group.

==Spell Vendors==
Starting Cities can have multiple vendors for class spells - they all sell the same spells. To keep the list manageable, only one is listed in each zone even though there are more nearby selling the same spells.
